From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:56:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: m4: make the media rate word of the
 adaptive-sync request selectable

panel_media_hz put the J604 panel's media target rate in the second word
of the adaptive-sync request. The 26.6.2 firmware logged the request with
the minimum taken and a media target rate of zero, so it reads that value
from another word; the desktop template describes the three values as
64-bit, which would put it in word 2.

Add panel_media_word (0644, default 2, 1 to 7) to choose the word, so the
place can be measured on the machine without a rebuild. Nothing is sent
differently while panel_media_hz is 0.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 532f16a4e0a280e4188a7a8eb8df548768a01452)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c | 18 +++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
index 40da61b4c6..7c7cf73195 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
@@ -205,6 +205,11 @@ module_param(panel_media_hz, uint, 0644);
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(panel_media_hz,
 		 "J604: mediaTargetRate of the internal panel's adaptive-sync request, Hz (experimental; default 0 = none; at most 120; applies from the next commit)");
 
+static unsigned int panel_media_word = 2;
+module_param(panel_media_word, uint, 0644);
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(panel_media_word,
+		 "J604: which 32-bit word (1-7) of the adaptive-sync request carries panel_media_hz (experimental; default 2, the second 64-bit value)");
+
 static bool panel_edr;
 /* Given on the command line or written: the machine default stays out. */
 static bool panel_edr_given;
@@ -3793,15 +3798,22 @@ static_assert(sizeof(struct dcp_m4_set_parameter) == 0x28);
 
 static int dcp_m4_set_adaptive_sync(struct iomfb_m4 *dcp, u32 min_rr, u32 media)
 {
-	/* minRR and mediaTargetRate, 16.16 Hz, then the fractional rate */
-	const struct dcp_m4_set_parameter param = {
+	/*
+	 * minRR and mediaTargetRate, 16.16 Hz, then the fractional rate. The
+	 * 26.6.2 firmware reads minRR from word 0; where it reads the media
+	 * rate is measured with panel_media_word (word 1 was not taken).
+	 */
+	struct dcp_m4_set_parameter param = {
 		.param = cpu_to_le32(DCP_M4_PARAM_ADAPTIVE_SYNC),
-		.value = { cpu_to_le32(min_rr), cpu_to_le32(media) },
+		.value = { cpu_to_le32(min_rr) },
 		.count = cpu_to_le32(3),
 	};
+	unsigned int word = clamp(READ_ONCE(panel_media_word), 1U, 7U);
 	__le32 status = 0;
 	int ret;
 
+	param.value[word] = cpu_to_le32(media);
+
 	lockdep_assert_held(&dcp->lock);
 	ret = dcp_m4_runtime_live(dcp->runtime);
 	if (ret)
-- 
